{"projectInfo":{"name":"OSPF Stub区域配置举例","path":"ospf2","visibility":2,"categoryId":38,"introduction":"所有的路由器都运行OSPF，整个自治系统划分为3个区域。其中Router A和Router B作为ABR来转发区域之间的路由，Router D作为ASBR引入了外部路由（静态路由）。要求将Area1配置为Stub区域，减少通告到此区域内的LSA数量，但不影响路由的可达性。","label":["OSPF","Stub"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"RouterB","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RouterB.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RouterC","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RouterC.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RouterA","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RouterA.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RouterD","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RouterD.cfg"}]}